 html←length PrepareHtmlPageForGroupList_(name latestMajor)
⍝ Returns the link to one package of a group on the groups page; see `PrepareHtmlPageForGroupList`.
⍝ The group is said once, in the heading, so the link shows the name without it: `length` is
⍝ the length of the group including its hyphen.
 html←'<a href="',Reg.VersionOf_REST,'/packages/versions/',latestMajor,'">',(EscapeSpecialChars length↓name),'</a>'
⍝Done
